OL,3,GNEWSAHow a music fan helped a band
OL,4,Aavoid Top of the Pops
OL,5,
OL,6,FA music fan who helped his idol escape
OL,7,Fplaying Top of the Pops says his
OL,8,Ffriends did not believe him until they
OL,9,Fheard the performance was cancelled on
OL,10,FBBC Radio 1 the next day.
OL,12,FIndie band The Wonder Stuff had
OL,13,Ffinished their gig in Cumbria when
OL,14,Fsinger Miles Hunt decided to go missing
OL,15,Fso they could avoid playing the music
OL,16,Fshow.
OL,18,FHunt left the Sands Centre in Carlisle
OL,19,Fthrough a side door and blagged a lift
OL,20,Fto a hotel in the city centre with Mark
OL,21,FGalbraith and three of his friends in
OL,22,FGalbraith's mum's blue Volvo.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,402,400,260,160,0,100
