OL,3,GNEWSAHow a music fan helped a band
OL,4,Aavoid Top of the Pops
OL,5,
OL,6,F"There wasn't any internet and there
OL,7,Fwas no way of corroborating any story
OL,8,Flike this other than waiting to hear it
OL,9,Fon the news," Galbraith said. "It was a
OL,10,Fdifferent era."
